# Acrobatic Cheerleader: "This ability triggers only once" holds for the object that triggered it. It attacks on turn 3 and gets
# its flying counter at the second main phase; Ephemerate (exile it, return it) then makes it a new object (CR 400.7) with no
# counter, untapped. On turn 5 the new object attacks, is tapped at the second main phase and triggers for the first time: one
# flying counter again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Plains
Mox Jet
Acrobatic Cheerleader
Ephemerate
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains#1.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Acrobatic Cheerleader.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Acrobatic Cheerleader > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Acrobatic Cheerleader.Counters.Flying = 1
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ephemerate.Cast(Acrobatic Cheerleader)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Acrobatic Cheerleader.Counters.Flying = (absent)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Acrobatic Cheerleader.Tapped = false
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Acrobatic Cheerleader > Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Acrobatic Cheerleader.Counters.Flying = 1
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Life = 16
